{"description":"Runs the offline unit suite whenever the detector core, its tests, or the frontend change, so a broken verdict rule is caught in the editing session instead of at submission time. The live network check (tests/live_port_check.mjs) stays manual on purpose: it hits BSC mainnet and does not belong in a save loop.","enabled":true,"name":"Run detector tests on save","then":{"command":"python3 -m unittest discover -s tests","type":"runCommand"},"version":"1","when":{"patterns":["detector.py","tests/**","frontend/index.html"],"type":"fileSaved"}}